Investigation and limitations
-----------------------------
An initial normal/tagged build attempt could not download klauspost/compress,
modernc.org/sqlite, and cloudflare/circl because the configured module proxy
closed the connections. An unchanged later retry of both builds succeeded;
dependencies, proxy settings, and cache/temp environment were not modified.

The first commit-hook run exposed that the shared JSON formatter sorts keys and
uses two-space indentation, while the initial generator output used struct field
order and four spaces. The generator now emits the same canonical JSON format;
regeneration and exact-byte artifact checking both pass.

Windows validation did not run mutation testing. No Docker/K3s/Helm runtime
validation was attempted or implied. Phase 2 runtime authorization and the
main-agent Phase 1 acceptance/postmortem remain open.
